{"version":1,"content":"<p>一項被稱為「全球首例脊髓移植」的手術近日引發國際醫學界高度關注。參與手術的外科醫生聲稱，他們已成功將一段來自腦死亡供體的健康脊髓組織移植到一名嚴重脊髓損傷患者體內。如果這一成果最終得到證實，將可能成為神經修復領域的重要裏程碑。然而，由於缺乏公開臨牀數據和同行評審證據，不少專家呼籲外界保持謹慎。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/science/1583290.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T15:41:41.950687+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":152,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T04:54:48+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T15:37:13.633892+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T15:37:13.633892+00:00","content_hash":"16a9bb16ef38e95c67ced6bda3ad1833fad9f564051554b2706065f2080e29f2","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}